/ ============================================================================
/ FLEXI ADMIN EXAMPLE: Bulk Action Modal Template — Delete
/ ============================================================================
/ modal(context) renders the modal dialog wrapper (header, footer, buttons).
/ Inside, use the form DSL for any inputs the action needs.
/
/ span.count is auto-populated by the bulk-action Stimulus controller
/ with the number of selected items.
/ ============================================================================

= modal(context) do |m|
  = form do
    p.text-danger
      ' Are you sure you want to delete
      span.count.fw-bold>
      | users? This action cannot be undone.
